  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=modloader&message=fabric&color=brightgreen\" alt=\"模組載入器：Fabric\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=environment&message=client/server&color=yellow\" alt=\"執行環境\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fAton-Kish%252fyour-reputation%252f1.21-wthit%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=licence&message=MIT&color=blue\" alt=\"MIT 授權條款\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatonkish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"贊助 Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<h1>你的聲望 (WTHIT)</h1>\n<p>你的聲望是一款 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wthit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WTHIT</a> 外掛，用於在村民的提示資訊中顯示你的聲望。</p>\n<p>適用於 1.20 之前 Minecraft 版本的原專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-reputation\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-reputation</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\" width=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wthit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WTHIT</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聲望等級</th>\n<th>數值</th>\n<th>提示圖示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>友好</td>\n<td>100 或以上</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/friendly.png\" alt=\"友好\" width=\"227\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可信</td>\n<td>介於 0 到 100 之間</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/trustworthy.png\" alt=\"可信\" width=\"240\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中立</td>\n<td>等於 0</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/neutral.png\" alt=\"中立\" width=\"228\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可疑</td>\n<td>介於 -100 到 0 之間</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/suspicious.png\" alt=\"可疑\" width=\"232\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敵對</td>\n<td>-100 或以下</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/hostile.png\" alt=\"敵對\" width=\"227\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>如果你的聲望為 &quot;敵對&quot;，村民會變成告密者。</p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/snitch.png\" alt=\"告密者\" width=\"227\">\n<p>接著，鐵傀儡會憤怒並開始攻擊你……</p>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Aton-Kish/your-reputation/1.21-wthit/images/angry_golem.png\" alt=\"憤怒的鐵傀儡\" width=\"241\">",
